<scheme version="2.0" title="Lab 6 - Text Mining and Clustering (airline tweets)" description="Turns a 10% sample of the airline tweets into a corpus, preprocesses it, shows word clouds and a document map, and clusters the tweets with hierarchical clustering and k-Means.">
