	<annotations>
		<text id="0" type="text/markdown" rect="(-60, 20, 300, 60)" font-family="Helvetica" font-size="14">**Lab 6**  
Text Mining and Clustering</text>
		<text id="1" type="text/markdown" rect="(-60, 400, 230, 130)" font-family="Helvetica" font-size="14">**Step 2: Load the tweets**  
Only the text columns are kept (name, text, tweet_coord, tweet_created, tweet_location).</text>
		<text id="2" type="text/markdown" rect="(160, 20, 220, 70)" font-family="Helvetica" font-size="14">**Step 2: Data Table**  
A look at the loaded tweets.</text>
		<text id="3" type="text/markdown" rect="(210, 420, 240, 110)" font-family="Helvetica" font-size="14">**Step 3: Sample and corpus**  
10% of the tweets, then a corpus that uses only the text column.</text>
		<text id="4" type="text/markdown" rect="(520, 400, 240, 150)" font-family="Helvetica" font-size="14">**Step 4: Preprocess Text**  
Lowercase, no accents, no URLs, stop words and RegExp filters, 100 most frequent tokens, n-grams 1 to 2.</text>
		<text id="5" type="text/markdown" rect="(720, 20, 220, 70)" font-family="Helvetica" font-size="14">**Steps 3-4: Word Cloud**  
The most common words.</text>
		<text id="6" type="text/markdown" rect="(720, 550, 230, 90)" font-family="Helvetica" font-size="14">**Step 5: Document Map**  
Tweets per US state, from tweet_location.</text>
		<text id="7" type="text/markdown" rect="(1010, 330, 250, 90)" font-family="Helvetica" font-size="14">**Step 6: Bag of Words**  
Count for term frequency, Smooth IDF for document frequency.</text>
		<text id="8" type="text/markdown" rect="(1010, 20, 300, 110)" font-family="Helvetica" font-size="14">**Step 7: Hierarchical clustering**  
Jaccard distances, complete linkage, Top N = 3. One Select Rows and one Word Cloud for each cluster.</text>
		<text id="9" type="text/markdown" rect="(940, 860, 320, 110)" font-family="Helvetica" font-size="14">**Step 8: k-Means**  
k = 3 on the same bag of words. One Select Rows and one Word Cloud for each cluster.</text>
		<text id="10" type="text/markdown" rect="(1740, 190, 220, 90)" font-family="Helvetica" font-size="14">**Step 7: Word clouds**  
Hierarchical clusters C1, C2 and C3.</text>
		<text id="11" type="text/markdown" rect="(1740, 730, 220, 90)" font-family="Helvetica" font-size="14">**Step 8: Word clouds**  
k-Means clusters C1, C2 and C3.</text>
